<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In When Seeing Is not Enough: Revealing the Limits of Active Reasoning in MLLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Verifying the reliability of the process.</span></a></li>
