<span id="A3.T8.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T8.2.14.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You are presented with a series of images, from which one is the correct answer. Your task is to identify this correct image by asking a series of questions within 10 turns. You must use all available images to formulate your questions, and ultimately output the number corresponding to the correct image.</span>
</span></td></tr>
