<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Case Study</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Dataset Cases</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide examples of images in Figure <a href="#A4.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ D.1 Dataset Cases ‣ Appendix D Case Study ‣ When Seeing Is not Enough: Revealing the Limits of Active Reasoning in MLLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> and Figure <a href="#A4.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ D.1 Dataset Cases ‣ Appendix D Case Study ‣ When Seeing Is not Enough: Revealing the Limits of Active Reasoning in MLLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, including images in the main procedure and edited images in further experiments.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F10" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.15421v1/dataset_case.png" id="A4.F10.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:452/435;" width="452" height="435" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>The cases of ten image fields.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F11" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.15421v1/edit_case.png" id="A4.F11.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:452/238;" width="452" height="238" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span>The cases of original images and edited images.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Active Reasoning Cases</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide three cases for illustration in Figure <a href="#A4.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ D.2 Active Reasoning Cases ‣ Appendix D Case Study ‣ When Seeing Is not Enough: Revealing the Limits of Active Reasoning in MLLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> and Figure <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ D.2 Active Reasoning Cases ‣ Appendix D Case Study ‣ When Seeing Is not Enough: Revealing the Limits of Active Reasoning in MLLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, including a good case, a bad case, and an explicit thinking case.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.F12" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.15421v1/case1.png" id="A4.F12.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:467/523;" width="467" height="523" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span>Case study: active reason. The left is Qwen2.5-VL-72B model, and the right is Qwen2.5-VL-32B model.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A4.F13" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.15421v1/case2.png" id="A4.F13.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:421/759;" width="421" height="759" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span>Case study: active reasoning with explicit thinking. The evaluated model is Mimo-VL model.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
